2). Intermediaries 689/340/560/1202 are low-degree (4\u201310 events), so the path is not an artifact of hub popularity, even though endpoints 563 and 1444 are high-degree (step_10).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_39db5e56\",\n  \"decision\": \"present\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [563, 689, 340, 560, 1202, 1444],\n  \"window\": [39152, 40117],\n  \"confidence\": 0.9,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"A strictly increasing chain of five verified directed events links 563 to 1444 between t=39152 and t=40117, with every consecutive gap (184, 319, 234, 228) below the 600-unit limit. The path is directional (no reverse route), uses low-degree intermediaries rather than hubs, reaches only ~4% of active nodes, and disappears when the critical time span is excluded \u2014 indicating a genuine temporal cascade rather than an artifact of volume, popularity, or time-ignorant connectivity.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 27870, "total_output_tokens": 2851, "total_tokens": 30721, "total_latency_ms": 38373, "llm_calls": 5, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}